    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a lead qualification assistant for ABC Real Estate.\n\nAnalyze this real-estate lead using the information below:\n\nProperty Interest: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.propertyInterest }}\nPreferred Location: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.preferredLocation }}\nMessage: {{ $('Edit Fields').item.json.message }}\n\nThe deterministic budget classification has already been calculated separately as:\n{{ $json.leadQualification }}\n\nDo NOT change or override the budget classification.\n\nYour task is only to assess the lead's intent from the property interest, preferred location, and message.\n\nReturn exactly two lines:\n\nAI Assessment: Strong Intent, Moderate Intent, or Weak Intent\nAI Reason: One short sentence explaining the assessment.\n\nDo not add any other text.",
        "options": {}
